### Inkoopfactuur / self-billing — party.role = creditor
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/accounting/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-Account-Id: {{accountId}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "type": "purchase_invoice",
  "external_id": "PINV-001",
  "number": "Inkoop 001",
  "issue_date": "2026-08-14",
  "party": { "role": "creditor", "name": "Hub Test Leverancier", "external_id": "LEV-001" },
  "lines": [
    { "description": "Onderaanneming", "amount": 500, "tax_rate": 21, "category": "kosten" }
  ]
}


### ─── Onbekende relatie ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Onbekende partij ZONDER create_if_missing → 422 REFERENCE_MAPPING_MISSING.
#   De Hub maakt niets aan tenzij het document erom vraagt.
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/accounting/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-Account-Id: {{accountId}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "type": "sales_invoice",
  "external_id": "NEW-001",
  "number": "Nieuwe klant zonder vlag",
  "issue_date": "2026-08-14",
  "party": { "role": "debtor", "name": "Gloednieuwe Klant BV", "external_id": "KLANT-NIEUW-001" },
  "lines": [
    { "description": "Consultancy", "amount": 100, "tax_rate": 21 }
  ]
}

### Zelfde partij MET create_if_missing → 201 + één nieuwe relatie in Exact.
#   `external_id` is verplicht zodra je deze vlag zet: zonder die sleutel kan de
#   Hub de aangemaakte relatie niet stabiel terugvinden en zou een tweede boeking
#   een duplicaat opleveren. Weigert op de edge.
#
#   Zet deze vlag alleen wanneer de gebruiker bewust een nieuwe relatie aanmaakt.
#   Standaard aanzetten betekent dat elke typefout in een partijnaam een nieuwe
#   relatie in de administratie van de klant zet.
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/accounting/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-Account-Id: {{accountId}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "type": "sales_invoice",
  "external_id": "NEW-002",
  "number": "Nieuwe klant met vlag",
  "issue_date": "2026-08-14",
  "party": {
    "role": "debtor",
    "name": "Gloednieuwe Klant BV",
    "external_id": "KLANT-NIEUW-001",
    "create_if_missing": true
  },
  "lines": [
    { "description": "Consultancy", "amount": 100, "tax_rate": 21 }
  ]
}


### ─── Foutpaden ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Zonder X-Account-Id → 400 missing_account_header
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/accounting/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "type": "sales_invoice",
  "external_id": "ERR-001",
  "number": "Zonder account-header",
  "issue_date": "2026-08-14",
  "party": { "role": "debtor", "name": "Hub Test Klant", "external_id": "KLANT-001" },
  "lines": [{ "description": "Consultancy", "amount": 100, "tax_rate": 21 }]
}

### Onbekend account → 404 account_not_found
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/accounting/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-Account-Id: bestaat-niet
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "type": "sales_invoice",
  "external_id": "ERR-002",
  "number": "Onbekend account",
  "issue_date": "2026-08-14",
  "party": { "role": "debtor", "name": "Hub Test Klant", "external_id": "KLANT-001" },
  "lines": [{ "description": "Consultancy", "amount": 100, "tax_rate": 21 }]
}

### Zonder PAT → 401 unauthenticated, JSON (geen login-redirect)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/accounting/documents
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-Account-Id: {{accountId}}


### ─── Controleren in Exact ───────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Wat is er geboekt? Verkoopboekingen met regels
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/exact/salesentry/SalesEntries?$top=5&$expand=SalesEntryLines
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
X-Account-Id: {{accountId}}

### Inkoopboekingen met regels
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/exact/purchaseentry/PurchaseEntries?$top=5&$expand=PurchaseEntryLines
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
X-Account-Id: {{accountId}}

### Hangt er een bijlage aan?
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/exact/documents/DocumentAttachments?$top=5&$select=ID,FileName,Document
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
X-Account-Id: {{accountId}}

### Welke relaties staan er nu?
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/exact/crm/Accounts?$top=20&$select=ID,Code,Name,VATNumber,IsSales,IsSupplier
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
X-Account-Id: {{accountId}}


### ─── Opruimen ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Niet via de API — DELETE is op de pass-through bewust geblokkeerd.
# Op de server, dry-run eerst:
#
#   php artisan exact:purge-test-data <connection-id>
#   php artisan exact:purge-test-data <connection-id> --force --relations=<guid>,<guid>
#
# Boekingen en Documents gaan er onvoorwaardelijk af; relaties alleen wat je
# expliciet opgeeft. Geef nooit de Exact-standaardrelatie
# "Belastingdienst Omzetbelasting" mee — die hoort bij de administratie.
